Description: Tools for evaluating multiclass classification models using ROC analysis, Hand-Till multiclass AUC, bootstrap confidence intervals, model comparison, plots of pairwise ROC curves, AUCs and bootstrap results, data validation, missing-value handling, and prediction outlier detection.
